. module: transportassurance
: model:res.groups,comment:transportassurance.groupassurancemanager
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Accès complet au module Assurance, y compris configuration,\n"
"                clôture de sinistres, validation des indemnités et rapports complets.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Full access to the Insurance module, including configuration,\n"
"                claim closure, indemnity validation, and comprehensive reports.\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typeviegroupe
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Couverture décès / invalidité permanente totale (IPT)\n"
"                pour l'ensemble du personnel. Versement du capital au bénéficiaire désigné.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Death / total permanent disability (TPD) coverage\n"
"                for all personnel. Payment of the capital to the designated beneficiary.\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typeatcnam
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Couverture obligatoire CNAM des accidents de travail et maladies\n"
"                professionnelles. Blessure survenue en service.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Mandatory CNAM coverage for work accidents and occupational diseases.\n"
"                Injury occurring during service.\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typerc
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Couverture obligatoire des dommages causés aux tiers\n"
"                (personnes et biens) lors d'un accident de circulation.\n"
"                Exige une visite technique annuelle valide (règle Tunisie).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Mandatory coverage for damages caused to third parties\n"
"                (persons and property) during a traffic accident.\n"
"                Requires a valid annual technical inspection (Tunisia rule).\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typevoyage
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Couverture obligatoire des passagers transportés en cas d'accident.\n"
"                Couvre les préjudices corporels des voyageurs à bord.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Mandatory coverage for transported passengers in case of an accident.\n"
"                Covers bodily injury to travelers on board.\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typetousrisques
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Couverture étendue des dommages au véhicule lui-même\n"
"                (collision, accident matériel) quelle qu'en soit la cause.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Extended coverage for damage to the vehicle itself\n"
"                (collision, material damage) regardless of the cause.\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:res.groups,comment:transportassurance.groupassurancegestionnaire
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Peut créer et gérer les polices d'assurance bus et chauffeurs,\n"
"                déclarer et instruire les sinistres.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Can create and manage bus and driver insurance policies,\n"
"                report and process claims.\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typeincendievol
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Protection spécifique contre l'incendie et le vol du véhicule\n"
"                (y compris tentative de vol et vandalisme).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Specific protection against fire and theft of the vehicle\n"
"                (including attempted theft and vandalism).\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typercpro
msgid ""
"\n"
"                RC du chauffeur en tant que professionnel de transport.\n"
"                Couvre les dommages causés dans l'exercice de ses fonctions.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Driver's liability as a transport professional.\n"
"                Covers damages caused in the performance of their duties.\n"
"            "

. module: transportassurance
: model:transport.assurance.type,description:transportassurance.typecomplementairesante
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Remboursement des frais médicaux au-delà de la prise en charge\n"
"                de la CNAM. Couverture hospitalisation, soins ambulatoires, optique.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Reimbursement of medical expenses beyond CNAM coverage.\n"
"                Coverage for hospitalization, outpatient care, and optical.\n"
"            "

